(6147609, 905126, 115307, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! Generally I don''t like lens flare, but here it truly makes the photo. The model is well photographed and the background creates added interest. 8</td>', 'Fantastic! Generally I don''t like lens flare, but here it truly makes the photo. The model is well photographed and the background creates added interest. 8', '2010-09-01 01:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6147612, 905772, 83313, '<td valign="top">Now that''s one for a parent to hang on the wall! The photography is very good, though not the "wow" that normally garners the highest votes. It gets one of my own highest, however, for the moment in time that you captured. Well done.</td>', 'Now that''s one for a parent to hang on the wall! The photography is very good, though not the "wow" that normally garners the highest votes. It gets one of my own highest, however, for the moment in time that you captured. Well done.', '2010-09-01 01:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6147621, 906726, 83313, '<td valign="top">Way over-processed. I suspect you may have been going for a certain look, but  it didn''t work well. Perhaps there is a monitor problem and you can''t see it the way I am seeing it.</td>', 'Way over-processed. I suspect you may have been going for a certain look, but  it didn''t work well. Perhaps there is a monitor problem and you can''t see it the way I am seeing it.', '2010-09-01 01:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6147623, 905956, 117534, '<td valign="top">There are so many good pictures in this challange, and so many HDR''s and highly edited pictures, it''s really refreshing to see a picture like this! And It jumped out at me more than some of the "big edit pix''s"  Very Nice Job!</td>', 'There are so many good pictures in this challange, and so many HDR''s and highly edited pictures, it''s really refreshing to see a picture like this! And It jumped out at me more than some of the "big edit pix''s"  Very Nice Job!', '2010-09-01 01:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
