(6147819, 906887, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awesome lake. Image looks a bit over-sharpened. Composition seems cluttered - focal point? Think you may have been able to do more to maximize on the beautiful reflections.</td>', 'Awesome lake. Image looks a bit over-sharpened. Composition seems cluttered - focal point? Think you may have been able to do more to maximize on the beautiful reflections.', '2010-09-01 04:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
