(6147826, 904625, 9668, '<td valign="top">Don''t mean to be harsh, just writing thoughts: <br/>Looks like you''ve cropped in tight on this image to get closer to this majestic bird. Which is a good idea, but the artifacting in the water makes it seem like a low resolution image. Nice composition though.</td>', 'Don''t mean to be harsh, just writing thoughts: Looks like you''ve cropped in tight on this image to get closer to this majestic bird. Which is a good idea, but the artifacting in the water makes it seem like a low resolution image. Nice composition though.', '2010-09-01 04:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6147828, 906852, 9668, '<td valign="top">Score guess: 6.54<br/>Wish the pinkdive wasn''t in the image, but nice action freeze. What is up with the massive vignetting? Like the entire sky is falling in.</td>', 'Score guess: 6.54Wish the pinkdive wasn''t in the image, but nice action freeze. What is up with the massive vignetting? Like the entire sky is falling in.', '2010-09-01 04:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6147830, 906645, 9668, '<td valign="top">Ha ha!<br/>Guessing this a macro of a hair brush, but funny.</td>', 'Ha ha!Guessing this a macro of a hair brush, but funny.', '2010-09-01 04:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6147834, 906825, 9668, '<td valign="top">Don''t mean to be harsh, just writing thoughts: <br/>Interesting cause this is an unusual scene for this audience, but what is happening in the scene isn''t interesting. Perhaps try capturing it from a different angle - high up or low down, to make the composition more interesting.</td>', 'Don''t mean to be harsh, just writing thoughts: Interesting cause this is an unusual scene for this audience, but what is happening in the scene isn''t interesting. Perhaps try capturing it from a different angle - high up or low down, to make the composition more interesting.', '2010-09-01 04:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6147837, 905126, 9668, '<td valign="top">Yay! A photographer who knows what they are doing!<br/> <br/>Lighting - stunning.<br/>Composition - Unusual but striking. <br/>Tonal values - high contrast, yet spot on. <br/>Post processing - overdone IMO (plastic looking), but that is how DPC likes it. <br/>Content: What is that look? Waiting for someone? Waiting for instructions? Just posing? The look doesn''t really grab my attention as much as I would like. <br/> <br/>Overall: excellent.</td>', 'Yay! A photographer who knows what they are doing! Lighting - stunning.Composition - Unusual but striking. Tonal values - high contrast, yet spot on. Post processing - overdone IMO (plastic looking), but that is how DPC likes it. Content: What is that look? Waiting for someone? Waiting for instructions? Just posing? The look doesn''t really grab my attention as much as I would like.  Overall: excellent.', '2010-09-01 04:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6147838, 901998, 9668, '<td valign="top">I see you!</td>', 'I see you!', '2010-09-01 04:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
