(6150109, 906821, 68546, '<td valign="top">Seems underexposed and not all that well composed to me. Lighting is also a little flat.  Nice expression from the model and ok posing though, just feels a little awkward in the composition.</td>', 'Seems underexposed and not all that well composed to me. Lighting is also a little flat.  Nice expression from the model and ok posing though, just feels a little awkward in the composition.', '2010-09-02 19:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150110, 906765, 68546, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, composition, and toning to this one. Looks a little soft on the eyes though?</td>', 'nice lighting, composition, and toning to this one. Looks a little soft on the eyes though?', '2010-09-02 19:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150112, 905057, 68546, '<td valign="top">lovely! perfectly composed and just a lovely feel to this one - 8</td>', 'lovely! perfectly composed and just a lovely feel to this one - 8', '2010-09-02 19:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150114, 905126, 68546, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2010-09-02 19:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150181, 905714, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful location! I had to find out where this is, and after googling, I found that all the waterfalls over basalt columns in the world occur only in Iceland and that this particular one is Svartifoss.<br/> <br/>I can imagine that the lighting didn''t cooperate and that the sky would be blown out if you included more of it, but without more room on the top the picture feels a little suffocating. Maybe a HDR next time?</td>', 'Beautiful location! I had to find out where this is, and after googling, I found that all the waterfalls over basalt columns in the world occur only in Iceland and that this particular one is Svartifoss. I can imagine that the lighting didn''t cooperate and that the sky would be blown out if you included more of it, but without more room on the top the picture feels a little suffocating. Maybe a HDR next time?', '2010-09-02 21:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150182, 906005, 59796, '<td valign="top">One scary albino alligator there! The shot gives me the chills everytime I look at it. Hoping to see it in the top 10.</td>', 'One scary albino alligator there! The shot gives me the chills everytime I look at it. Hoping to see it in the top 10.', '2010-09-02 21:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150184, 906586, 59796, '<td valign="top">Could be a windows background! Pleasing colors and good composition. Not so sure about the title - it''s still oil after all! :)</td>', 'Could be a windows background! Pleasing colors and good composition. Not so sure about the title - it''s still oil after all! :)', '2010-09-02 21:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150186, 903000, 59796, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking colors and composition! Very nicely done.<br/>I hope this ribbons. <br/>Would love to know how you managed this.</td>', 'Breathtaking colors and composition! Very nicely done.I hope this ribbons. Would love to know how you managed this.', '2010-09-02 21:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150209, 906810, 59796, '<td valign="top">Could be somewhere outside hell for all I''m concerned. That''s one angry/scary sky!<br/>Great capture and post-processing. Would love to know how you did this. The blurry clouds at the top are slightly distracting, but I guess you couldn''t avoid that. Hope this one ends up in the top 10.</td>', 'Could be somewhere outside hell for all I''m concerned. That''s one angry/scary sky!Great capture and post-processing. Would love to know how you did this. The blurry clouds at the top are slightly distracting, but I guess you couldn''t avoid that. Hope this one ends up in the top 10.', '2010-09-02 21:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150229, 906037, 59796, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors, texture, and composition. Sunrise I take it? All you Icelanders must feel so lucky to be living amongst such beautiful nature. I hope this ribbons.</td>', 'Amazing colors, texture, and composition. Sunrise I take it? All you Icelanders must feel so lucky to be living amongst such beautiful nature. I hope this ribbons.', '2010-09-02 21:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
