(6151035, 906807, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this is just a little too bright... Some of the details of the feathers are lost in the highlights. Good solid background.</td>', 'I think this is just a little too bright... Some of the details of the feathers are lost in the highlights. Good solid background.', '2010-09-03 14:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
