(6151390, 906566, 96751, '<td valign="top">A wonderful surrealist image.  I almost wish it was cropped a bit because the immensely soaring ceiling really removes me from the main subjects.  Also, I''m sure this is due to low light conditions, it''s a rather noisy image.  But it''s truly wonderful.</td>', 'A wonderful surrealist image.  I almost wish it was cropped a bit because the immensely soaring ceiling really removes me from the main subjects.  Also, I''m sure this is due to low light conditions, it''s a rather noisy image.  But it''s truly wonderful.', '2010-09-03 20:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151391, 906679, 10785, '<td valign="top">Looks like there is a white hot spot on the background at the right, also a grey one on his shirt at bottom right. You can clone that out in advanced editing.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, very good one light portrait.</td>', 'Looks like there is a white hot spot on the background at the right, also a grey one on his shirt at bottom right. You can clone that out in advanced editing. Otherwise, very good one light portrait.', '2010-09-03 20:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
