(6151400, 905698, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think there is somewhat of a movement to create end of life(style) photography, showing the sick or elderly in their natural element. I can appreciate the style. One thing I would do for this, if your intention was to make it that type of photo, would be to make it darker or low key. Here the bright light just doesn''t portray the same emotion the woman is showing.</td>', 'I think there is somewhat of a movement to create end of life(style) photography, showing the sick or elderly in their natural element. I can appreciate the style. One thing I would do for this, if your intention was to make it that type of photo, would be to make it darker or low key. Here the bright light just doesn''t portray the same emotion the woman is showing.', '2010-09-03 20:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151412, 905587, 10785, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is a little shallow on this one. The nose is the only thing in focus. You really want that focus on the eyes.</td>', 'Depth of field is a little shallow on this one. The nose is the only thing in focus. You really want that focus on the eyes.', '2010-09-03 21:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
