(6152564, 906638, 23484, '<td valign="top">Looks like something straight out of a horror film.</td>', 'Looks like something straight out of a horror film.', '2010-09-05 14:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152575, 901814, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great color. Overall the photo is very dark. I understand the yellow light is supposed to stand out as a pop of color and it does well against the blue lighting. I just think the remainder of the photo is very dark.</td>', 'Great color. Overall the photo is very dark. I understand the yellow light is supposed to stand out as a pop of color and it does well against the blue lighting. I just think the remainder of the photo is very dark.', '2010-09-05 14:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152578, 905712, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think the shutter speed may be a tad low. I can see some evidence of camera shake at the left door and the people aren''t very sharp.</td>', 'I think the shutter speed may be a tad low. I can see some evidence of camera shake at the left door and the people aren''t very sharp.', '2010-09-05 15:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
