(6152604, 906481, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is so weird, and funny. I like the tilt and the oddness of this. Not a fan of the huge and useless frame.</td>', 'This is so weird, and funny. I like the tilt and the oddness of this. Not a fan of the huge and useless frame.', '2010-09-05 15:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152605, 906389, 44877, '<td valign="top">Sweet capture! Hope it''s appreciated.</td>', 'Sweet capture! Hope it''s appreciated.', '2010-09-05 15:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152620, 905698, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: What an honest portrayal of life. It is seldom that we get to see an image with this level of authenticity and as a consequence it can''t be judged by conventional aesthetic measures. Her gaze, off to the side as it is, adds much interest and the light, flat and slightly stark hides little.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing<br/> <br/>Overall: Inspiring stuff. Reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=100385" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Shetland</a>''s ''This is Britain''.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: What an honest portrayal of life. It is seldom that we get to see an image with this level of authenticity and as a consequence it can''t be judged by conventional aesthetic measures. Her gaze, off to the side as it is, adds much interest and the light, flat and slightly stark hides little. Critical stuff: Nothing Overall: Inspiring stuff. Reminds me of  Shetland''s ''This is Britain''.', '2010-09-05 16:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152629, 906390, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2010-09-05 16:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152632, 906829, 98132, '<td valign="top">this is very picturesque as well as film driven...i love the melancholy mood and the contrast of light and dark values..very nice!</td>', 'this is very picturesque as well as film driven...i love the melancholy mood and the contrast of light and dark values..very nice!', '2010-09-05 16:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152640, 904441, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I like unconventional portraits and this one is no exception. What an interesting character and well photographed too. The POV, the repeating purple coloration, the long and deep shadows; all very effective. I really like that this is a posed portrait too - that is unexpected.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing<br/> <br/>Overall: Original and compelling.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I like unconventional portraits and this one is no exception. What an interesting character and well photographed too. The POV, the repeating purple coloration, the long and deep shadows; all very effective. I really like that this is a posed portrait too - that is unexpected. Critical stuff: Nothing Overall: Original and compelling.', '2010-09-05 16:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152642, 906707, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This is a well crafted image which is rich in textural detail. I like the subtle hues too. The abandoned bag provides just enough focus without distracting from the wider scene.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing really.<br/> <br/>Overall: Nicely done.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This is a well crafted image which is rich in textural detail. I like the subtle hues too. The abandoned bag provides just enough focus without distracting from the wider scene. Critical stuff: Nothing really. Overall: Nicely done.', '2010-09-05 17:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152643, 905775, 100393, '<td valign="top">Superb  wildlife shot.</td>', 'Superb  wildlife shot.', '2010-09-05 17:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152656, 906413, 20799, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite! Something about the expression that made me come back and look at the photo again. -10-</td>', 'This is my favorite! Something about the expression that made me come back and look at the photo again. -10-', '2010-09-05 17:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152658, 905214, 20799, '<td valign="top">A true Escher, I was confused with the stairs. Great shot!</td>', 'A true Escher, I was confused with the stairs. Great shot!', '2010-09-05 17:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152666, 905425, 100393, '<td valign="top">Kevin - I don''t this this one has nearly the power of your ''rust'' entry - the overlay of your ''political'' view in the title of that one made that one very personal and felt like a truly artistic expression. To be honest, it was technically a better picture than this one too. This is still an interesting subject but has lost some of its first-time power.</td>', 'Kevin - I don''t this this one has nearly the power of your ''rust'' entry - the overlay of your ''political'' view in the title of that one made that one very personal and felt like a truly artistic expression. To be honest, it was technically a better picture than this one too. This is still an interesting subject but has lost some of its first-time power.', '2010-09-05 17:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152681, 902167, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I knew I''d seen this image before - it stuck in my mind (I remembered her bare feet in the mud) and I checked back on 1x and there it was. It is truly great work though, the figure, the scene, the depth you have preserved - all the way back to the background wreckage; all make for a fantastic, sensitive, thought provoking piece. I also like the way she is walking towards a dark place in your image, reinforcing the metaphor in your title with photographic luminosity.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all.<br/> <br/>Overall: I expect to see this on the front page. An easy 10 from me to help it on its way.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I knew I''d seen this image before - it stuck in my mind (I remembered her bare feet in the mud) and I checked back on 1x and there it was. It is truly great work though, the figure, the scene, the depth you have preserved - all the way back to the background wreckage; all make for a fantastic, sensitive, thought provoking piece. I also like the way she is walking towards a dark place in your image, reinforcing the metaphor in your title with photographic luminosity. Critical stuff: Nothing at all. Overall: I expect to see this on the front page. An easy 10 from me to help it on its way.', '2010-09-05 18:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152801, 906700, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice city shot.</td>', 'Nice city shot.', '2010-09-05 22:23:58.000000', NULL, 1);
