(6153139, 902167, 40391, '<td valign="top">Of the 166 shots I''ve voted on so far this is by the far the best I''ve seen. Interesting lighting, works very well in B&amp;W, but the reason I''ve Faved this is because of the emotion and stories this gives me.  Well done! 10</td>', 'Of the 166 shots I''ve voted on so far this is by the far the best I''ve seen. Interesting lighting, works very well in B&W, but the reason I''ve Faved this is because of the emotion and stories this gives me.  Well done! 10', '2010-09-06 05:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
