(6153152, 904201, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is great! You not only see the demon but you can feel this demon in this image.  Everytime I look at this I see something new as this plays with my mind.  This has a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a> feel for me.  If it''s not Don I''m sure it is something he would appreciate.  Love it 10!</td>', 'This is great! You not only see the demon but you can feel this demon in this image.  Everytime I look at this I see something new as this plays with my mind.  This has a  posthumous feel for me.  If it''s not Don I''m sure it is something he would appreciate.  Love it 10!', '2010-09-06 06:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
