(6153292, 905366, 115814, '<td valign="top">Not a member [yet...] so I can''t vote. Instead I''m clicking through the images and commenting on those that make me stop and look. This is one of those images.<br/> <br/>Not sure how much of the color palette was a result of post-processing vs the actual scene. Regardless this is a really effective use of limited colors (red/rust and greens). I wasn''t initially sure what drew me to the photo. As I look more carefully, it''s the combination of composition and color. Kudos... hope it does well.</td>', 'Not a member [yet...] so I can''t vote. Instead I''m clicking through the images and commenting on those that make me stop and look. This is one of those images. Not sure how much of the color palette was a result of post-processing vs the actual scene. Regardless this is a really effective use of limited colors (red/rust and greens). I wasn''t initially sure what drew me to the photo. As I look more carefully, it''s the combination of composition and color. Kudos... hope it does well.', '2010-09-06 09:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
