(6153817, 906705, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks like some residual <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60915" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nixter</a>. I want to like this more than I do, but it feels kind of accidental -- or disjointed. I''m not making a connection between your two subjects, though your composition suggests that maybe there is one. <br/> <br/>And what''s the dying breed? Smokers? Straphangers? Blurry people? I must be missing something (wouldn''t be the first time)...</td>', 'Looks like some residual  nixter. I want to like this more than I do, but it feels kind of accidental -- or disjointed. I''m not making a connection between your two subjects, though your composition suggests that maybe there is one.  And what''s the dying breed? Smokers? Straphangers? Blurry people? I must be missing something (wouldn''t be the first time)...', '2010-09-06 18:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
