(6155156, 901985, 68546, '<td valign="top">Nice catchlights in the eyes, but the lighting is a little flat and "up" the face. Composition is good and I like the gradient in the background but the expression looks a little bored</td>', 'Nice catchlights in the eyes, but the lighting is a little flat and "up" the face. Composition is good and I like the gradient in the background but the expression looks a little bored', '2010-09-07 19:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6155157, 905958, 68546, '<td valign="top">interesting use of negative space, very simple but I like it a lot</td>', 'interesting use of negative space, very simple but I like it a lot', '2010-09-07 19:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6155160, 906508, 68546, '<td valign="top">Nice shallow DOF but I think maybe a touch off for focus on the eyes? The lighting is great but I would have preferred just a touch more light in the left eye (camera right) but still keeping the nose shadow connected to the cheekbone shadow</td>', 'Nice shallow DOF but I think maybe a touch off for focus on the eyes? The lighting is great but I would have preferred just a touch more light in the left eye (camera right) but still keeping the nose shadow connected to the cheekbone shadow', '2010-09-07 19:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
