(6155165, 905101, 68546, '<td valign="top">This one looked great in the thumbnail, but I''m not at all keen on the processing. Mainly on the eyes as they just look so fake. Without that and the excessive noise reduction on the skin this could be really good, composition is great. The processing completely kills it for me</td>', 'This one looked great in the thumbnail, but I''m not at all keen on the processing. Mainly on the eyes as they just look so fake. Without that and the excessive noise reduction on the skin this could be really good, composition is great. The processing completely kills it for me', '2010-09-07 19:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
