(6155474, 906636, 15511, '<td valign="top">The effort to smooth the skin on her face results in an artificial appearance that masks shape and form. The composition and pose is quite nice.</td>', 'The effort to smooth the skin on her face results in an artificial appearance that masks shape and form. The composition and pose is quite nice.', '2010-09-08 00:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
