(6155634, 906306, 5112, '<td valign="top">We are neighbours!  And you''re good.  Love the movement in this one, and (as so often) the colours.  B&amp;W is great, but colours are so juicy :)  <br/> <br/>PS -- that piece of glass, I made it to make photos getting soot on it by burning an old garden hose, but then I got the glass all wet and it got completely messed up.  Got to make a new one.</td>', 'We are neighbours!  And you''re good.  Love the movement in this one, and (as so often) the colours.  B&W is great, but colours are so juicy :)   PS -- that piece of glass, I made it to make photos getting soot on it by burning an old garden hose, but then I got the glass all wet and it got completely messed up.  Got to make a new one.', '2010-09-08 01:38:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6155635, 905762, 17507, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, man, and awesome finish! Nice going all around :)</td>', 'Awesome shot, man, and awesome finish! Nice going all around :)', '2010-09-08 01:38:58.000000', NULL, 0),
