(6156198, 905733, 5515, '<td valign="top">Hey all, thought it would do a bit better but where it is isn''t bad... Sara, it''s not selective desaturation, it''s just white objects with a correct color balance setting and constant temp lighting. There is some ''warmth'' coming through the hand a bit but it was the best I could do. <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments and votes. :D</td>', 'Hey all, thought it would do a bit better but where it is isn''t bad... Sara, it''s not selective desaturation, it''s just white objects with a correct color balance setting and constant temp lighting. There is some ''warmth'' coming through the hand a bit but it was the best I could do.  Thanks for the comments and votes. :D', '2010-09-08 11:04:56.000000', NULL, 0),
