(6156358, 905366, 65319, '<td valign="top">Oh...this image''s stunning colors is like something right out of Poison Ivy''s garden!  Do you remember the marvelous Uma Thurman who played the character from the movie <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Batman_&amp;_Robin_%28film%29" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Batman &amp; Robin</a>?  Beautiful lighting and larger than life detail in the gas pump!  Amazing how you take a simple scene and create a cinematic setting.  Really...you should work for the movies, Jeb!  Beautiful!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-08 12:26:15.</i></td>', 'Oh...this image''s stunning colors is like something right out of Poison Ivy''s garden!  Do you remember the marvelous Uma Thurman who played the character from the movie Batman & Robin?  Beautiful lighting and larger than life detail in the gas pump!  Amazing how you take a simple scene and create a cinematic setting.  Really...you should work for the movies, Jeb!  Beautiful!', '2010-09-08 13:25:12.000000', '2010-09-08 13:26:15.000000', 0),
(6156366, 905366, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot Jeb!  Congrats on the first FS 6+.  I still can''t believe it''s your first.  You hit the saturation just right here and I need some processing pointers for this look.</td>', 'This is a nice shot Jeb!  Congrats on the first FS 6+.  I still can''t believe it''s your first.  You hit the saturation just right here and I need some processing pointers for this look.', '2010-09-08 13:28:32.000000', NULL, 0),
