(6156407, 906585, 59796, '<td valign="top">Certainly not my best work, but 1''s and 2''s? On the other hand, I am very grateful for those of you who rated this highly. I''m also beginning to understand that this kind of shots have become a cliche on DPC, and that there are a few photographers (IreneM for eg) who do this extremely well. I''ll keep learning and hopefully get to the standard beyond cliche.</td>', 'Certainly not my best work, but 1''s and 2''s? On the other hand, I am very grateful for those of you who rated this highly. I''m also beginning to understand that this kind of shots have become a cliche on DPC, and that there are a few photographers (IreneM for eg) who do this extremely well. I''ll keep learning and hopefully get to the standard beyond cliche.', '2010-09-08 13:43:13.000000', NULL, 0),
