(6158210, 905214, 20799, '<td valign="top">I checked back to see how this photo did in the challenge. It''s a wonderful Escher twisted perspective. And it''s St.Duje cathedral in Split? I thought it looked familiar!<br/></td>', 'I checked back to see how this photo did in the challenge. It''s a wonderful Escher twisted perspective. And it''s St.Duje cathedral in Split? I thought it looked familiar!', '2010-09-10 05:45:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6158387, 905214, 85102, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tome:</b></div><hr/><i> I checked back to see how this photo did in the challenge. It''s a wonderful Escher twisted perspective. And it''s St.Duje cathedral in Split? I thought it looked familiar! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m impressed you recognized it! Yes, it was in Split! I''m glad you liked it. I really liked it, but I knew it was pretty daring to enter it in the free study. I wasn''t expecting much, but I''m happy with the outcome :)<br/> <br/><b>Thanks for all of your support!</b></td>', 'Originally posted by tome: I checked back to see how this photo did in the challenge. It''s a wonderful Escher twisted perspective. And it''s St.Duje cathedral in Split? I thought it looked familiar!   I''m impressed you recognized it! Yes, it was in Split! I''m glad you liked it. I really liked it, but I knew it was pretty daring to enter it in the free study. I wasn''t expecting much, but I''m happy with the outcome :) Thanks for all of your support!', '2010-09-10 11:58:57.000000', NULL, 0),
