(6164484, 905136, 67145, '<td valign="top">i saw this amazing shot when i was looking thru the free study .. <br/>its incredible ... you can be looking for weeks and never find this sort of scene .. must say, that goldenrod must be very patient .. !! ..  congrats on an excellent image .. :)<br/>ps .. thankyou so much for the pm .. i agree that when it comes to shooting insects in their natural environment practice practice and more practice is the way top go .. really enjoying doing it is helpful and patience &amp; enthusiasm are other excellent ingredients .. i''m not that patient so i must miss out on a lot of great shots .. !!</td>', 'i saw this amazing shot when i was looking thru the free study .. its incredible ... you can be looking for weeks and never find this sort of scene .. must say, that goldenrod must be very patient .. !! ..  congrats on an excellent image .. :)ps .. thankyou so much for the pm .. i agree that when it comes to shooting insects in their natural environment practice practice and more practice is the way top go .. really enjoying doing it is helpful and patience & enthusiasm are other excellent ingredients .. i''m not that patient so i must miss out on a lot of great shots .. !!', '2010-09-17 01:36:33.000000', NULL, 0),
