(6165159, 905961, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice shot Penny, pure geometry! I guess, for a higher score, I would''ve either tried for a less featureless sky (sorry for a double negative :)), or crop some sky from the top closer to the building. This broad swath of white does not add much to the image</td>', 'nice shot Penny, pure geometry! I guess, for a higher score, I would''ve either tried for a less featureless sky (sorry for a double negative :)), or crop some sky from the top closer to the building. This broad swath of white does not add much to the image', '2010-09-17 23:22:01.000000', NULL, 0),
