(6171223, 901656, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is actually a decent photo. The degree of difficulty is Very high. The execution good. However, it is an oft repeated subject and to score well it needs to be essentially perfect. 1% less than perfect and it will get hammered. You haven''t been here very long and I hope your score doesn''t get you down. Looking at your challenge entries it''s clear to me you have talent. Keep working at it and you''ll improve. If you ever want someone to bounce ideas off of, or to give you informal reactions to a photo, I''m happy to do it. Best of luck on future photos!</td>', 'This is actually a decent photo. The degree of difficulty is Very high. The execution good. However, it is an oft repeated subject and to score well it needs to be essentially perfect. 1% less than perfect and it will get hammered. You haven''t been here very long and I hope your score doesn''t get you down. Looking at your challenge entries it''s clear to me you have talent. Keep working at it and you''ll improve. If you ever want someone to bounce ideas off of, or to give you informal reactions to a photo, I''m happy to do it. Best of luck on future photos!', '2010-09-24 17:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
