(6176017, 906306, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - rich in colour and movement, with a whole carried question of who is pushing the bike ? Are they young or old ? Male or female, do they have shopping on the back or a kiddies seat ? And where are they going ? or maybe coming from ? Work ? Home ? Out to meet friends ? Are they in a rush ? Are they excited - full of dreams to share and happy crazy plans fighting in their head - wanting to spill out to a bigger audience ?<br/> <br/>The gold colour lifts this and gives a rich positive feel to the whole narrative process . .<br/> <br/>Aother of your shots Deb that if people take the time to look at and ponder they get drawn into a whole world of wondering and enjoyment.<br/> <br/>Very nice.</td>', 'Lovely shot - rich in colour and movement, with a whole carried question of who is pushing the bike ? Are they young or old ? Male or female, do they have shopping on the back or a kiddies seat ? And where are they going ? or maybe coming from ? Work ? Home ? Out to meet friends ? Are they in a rush ? Are they excited - full of dreams to share and happy crazy plans fighting in their head - wanting to spill out to a bigger audience ? The gold colour lifts this and gives a rich positive feel to the whole narrative process . . Aother of your shots Deb that if people take the time to look at and ponder they get drawn into a whole world of wondering and enjoyment. Very nice.', '2010-09-30 15:08:59.000000', NULL, 0),
